# ImmuDB signing key pair (generated by "make keygen"; never commit private key)
keys/signing.key
keys/signing.pub

# D22/D23 (Phase 3b) key pairs, generated by the same "make keygen":
#   writer-decision      decision-service signs the records it writes
#   writer-control-plane the control plane signs the erasure tombstone
#   anchor-signing       anchor-service signs Rekor submissions
# Ignored as a directory glob rather than name by name, so a key pair added
# later is ignored by default instead of committed by default. The PUBLIC
# halves the tests need are committed deliberately, under
# tests/fixtures/evidence_bundles/, which this pattern does not reach.
keys/*.key
keys/*.pub

# D14 (Phase 2) demonstration vault token - generated by "make keygen",
# delivered to the decision-service container only via a Compose secret.
# Never commit it, same reasoning as the signing key above.
decision_service/secrets/vault_api_token.txt
